WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Read the release change. The upload limit grows from 5 to 10 MB. Existing supported files must still upload.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Keep the old promises. A 7 MB upload is newly allowed. A failed 3 MB upload is a regression.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Select evidence, not guesses. Check preserved behavior and new limits. Do not flag intentional changes as bugs.
